<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" itunes:timing="None" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><translations/><songwriters><songwriter>Bam Mastro</songwriter><songwriter>Bayu Adisapoetra</songwriter><songwriter>Kevin Septanto</songwriter></songwriters></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body><div><p>You belong to nobody</p><p>But the one above you</p><p>I know there’s nowhere to be</p><p>But somewhere near the truth</p><p>I can’t help this feeling</p><p>It’s so good</p><p>So good</p><p>And I’m letting lose</p><p>Going all out tonight</p><p>If it’s all right</p><p>I know that your love must be the light that guides me</p><p>‘Cus I know maybe this much is true</p><p>I know that I won’t leave it all behind</p><p>I can’t help this feeling</p><p>It’s so good</p><p>So good</p><p>And I’m letting loose</p><p>Going all out tonight</p><p>It’s all right</p><p>I can’t help this feeling</p><p>It’s so good</p><p>So good</p><p>And I’m letting loose</p><p>Going all out tonight</p><p>It’s all right</p><p>I can’t help this feeling</p><p>It’s so good</p><p>So good</p><p>And I’m letting loose</p><p>Going all out tonight</p><p>It’s all right</p><p>I can’t help this feeling</p><p>It’s so good</p><p>So good</p><p>And I’m letting loose</p><p>Going all out tonight</p><p>It’s all right</p><p>Emotion</p><p>Emotion</p><p>Emotion</p><p>Devotion</p><p>Devotion</p><p>Devotion</p><p>Emotion</p><p>Emotion</p><p>Emotion</p><p>Devotion</p><p>Devotion</p><p>Devotion</p></div></body></tt>